<description>&lt;p&gt;The military court in the Democratic Republic of Congo has sentenced 66 soldiers to death for cowardice and mutiny after they fled fighting FRN rebels, intensifying pressure on the FARDC as the FRN advances on multiple fronts. ISIS-linked militants killed 33 people, prompting patients to flee a hospital and raising concerns about Ebola spread in the region. Allied Democratic Forces militants attacked Cantine in North Kivu, further destabilising the area. The Africa CDC called for a humanitarian corridor to protect Ebola response efforts. Battle-related deaths totaled 1,158 in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;DW.com&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiW0FVX3lxTE5wenV4UGRtcTg3SFF4a0pKSk4xb1J0MTRkNGU4N2R3U0Jnaktrd3lkZE1NNHpDMFBrU1RzWVYzSkd1NEZoS1NDOTRsaUo4ak5FS3V6Tzl1WnFtMWc?oc=5&quot;&gt;BBC&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMihwFBVV95cUxPNzVIUTg0LTI3ZzEya0d5QXo0Q2tzY0pmaVg2bzN3cXJnd1lyc0lCQlFyY3JXbjJURmNnazRtYUZXY0pNazBKem5BSDFGY3M2cGlMWVZfR2ZvcDhCMWdyZFlJOWF6S0s4YkhrSTJobTlTM3FOQ1FnalMyMHZPMVJCTmhvRl9vTW8?oc=5&quot;&gt;Haberler.com&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMifEFVX3lxTFBlN1B6RzFWTGZwZUpDYkM2a2xuUlMtZmtOVEVoVEphM3N1anVyeFcyR3ZlN20tREtLR19PVWJmRlpkbjk0alF6ekR0T2R5MWVTd0JaZ0pOVEJ6RG9XWmVEVVpHbjNQcFN3eVo0UnM4YVRaMnMyNFlwZ0lwY2s?oc=5&quot;&gt;theopenpress.in&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMikwFBVV95cUxNTUN3N0pzOHA3b2diakFaMy11WFd4UUJTcHZ0ZzdDbFIzY2dUc1BFNEN4RDdQOWF3UTJNU2xEbEZIVDJoNGFpMW14OGhtZVdMVE5MTWVPZHpoemwtMjZZQkE0UThwUHhDaE1Qa2JvcjYzQ2lIU2phQlEzYURqMjlnd1R1TFJ2ZkFBM1RDalBiaU9BZEE?oc=5&quot;&gt;ColombiaOne.com&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiZ0FVX3lxTE42eThoTlMwZmZCakp4bXdxcFk1N2ZLT0E1